WHO   — The Hive Queen — the last of the Formics
WHAT  — The surviving queen of the Formics, a single mind distributed across countless bound bodies.
WHERE — EN1 · Enderverse  Framework inputs: The Ender Quintet  Conductor / external anchor: ROOT0 (catalogued into UD0)
